{
  "goal": "Record a COMPLETE funds-transfer capability against MERIDIAN CORE. (1) Sign on: Operator ID, Password, leave Branch, click Sign On. (2) Open Member Inquiry, search by Member Number for the memberId parameter, click Select. (3) Click 'Funds Transfer'. (4) On the form: for From Share call choose with option = the fromShare parameter value verbatim (it is the option's underlying value attribute, NOT the visible label); for To Share choose the toShare parameter value verbatim; type amount into Amount; type memo into Memo; click Continue. (5) On CONFIRM FUNDS TRANSFER the money has NOT moved — click 'Post Transfer' with irreversible=true (a human pre-authorised this recording). (6) On the receipt screen, use read to capture the confirmation/reference number into an output named 'confirmationNumber' — target the value cell that sits next to the 'Confirmation:' label. (7) Then declare_done with capability_id 'member.transferFunds'.",
